    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Hazard Prediction Matrix.</strong> Your gut runs simulations a few seconds ahead of everyone else.</p><ul><li>You gain a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Intrigue check</strong> made to avoid <strong>traps, collapsing structures, and sudden environmental hazards</strong>.</li><li>When you or your party would trigger a hazard tied to a symbolic anomaly (Qliphothic residue, misaligned ley-line, unstable Spark field), the GM may allow you a <strong>last-moment Perception (Mind) or Occult (Mind) check</strong> to notice and warn others before it goes off.</li></ul>",
